Feature addition: fix torus movement + add multiplayer aura/kill attribution system.

This commit modifies 8 files (+652/-60 lines), spanning 5 TypeScript source, 1 documentation, 1 game entities.
This feature extends the Geometry Wars 3D codebase with new functionality. The implementation follows the project's established patterns and maintains compatibility with both single-player and multiplayer code paths where applicable.

Additional context from the commit body:
Torus fix: MeshWalker now maintains a persistent tangent frame that
smoothly rotates with the surface, eliminating the camera flip/mirror
issue caused by discontinuous Gram-Schmidt reference vector switching.
Camera position and up vector are now lerped for smooth transitions.

Aura system: Added KillTracker (kill/assist attribution via bullet
ownerId + enemy damage tracking) and AuraManager (5-tier proximity
buff system with damage multipliers and healing). Players near allies
get buffs that grow with kills+assists, showing satisfying "+N ASSIST"
popups for co-op kills.

